ster plans and decided to stop them at any cost and save his people from extinction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/f0fb26b746ba02f54626f3f29b96c622.poster.avif?t=1750258755\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/f0fb26b746ba02f54626f3f29b96c622.webm?t=1750258755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/f0fb26b746ba02f54626f3f29b96c622.mp4?t=1750258755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Reptilian can run, jump, dash, wall-kick, and climb on walls and ceilings. He can attack using claws and his tail, spit acid, and bite.  <br><br>Using all these abilities, you must explore levels, overcome obstacles, and avoid traps. Each level presents small challenges: find and collect all batteries, which serve as keys to doors, or defeat enemies and rescue your trapped friends.  <br><br>You can choose your own approach to dealing with the sinister corporation\u2019s soldiers\u2014jump down from the ceiling using stealth or engage them head-on with claws or acid attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/190deaef1069229f50396273d21ecbd1.poster.avif?t=1750258755\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/190deaef1069229f50396273d21ecbd1.webm?t=1750258755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/190deaef1069229f50396273d21ecbd1.mp4?t=1750258755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Local Co-op for Two Players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/dba45c03e73cbc99906b290d063e9972.avif?t=1750258755\" width=738 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/b5301f377c802b453f1d916e09765c07.poster.avif?t=1750258755\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/b5301f377c802b453f1d916e09765c07.webm?t=1750258755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/b5301f377c802b453f1d916e09765c07.mp4?t=1750258755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/12bcd95bac8ee6ca82c89f700773327e.poster.avif?t=1750258755\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/12bcd95bac8ee6ca82c89f700773327e.webm?t=1750258755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338470/extras/12bcd95bac8ee6ca82c89f700773327e.mp4?t=1750258755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging setting and agile main character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoon-style graphics and animations, including animated cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer for two players</p></li></ul>",
